  "description": {
   "en": "\"My mother's body had no heart.\" \n\nKikumitsu Genma is a cheerful, if slightly spaced out, high school girl, recently orphaned after the death of her mother.  After moving in with some relatives, she picks up a part-time job at a local cafe with her schoolmate.\n\nKikumitsu is also a \"second generation\" demon, capable of taking a knife to the face with no issue and able to rip off your head without a moment's thought.\n\nShe's working to save up money so she can finally visit her absent her father.  But who - or what, more accurately - is he...?\n\nPS \"Nisei\" (\"second generation\") is a term used to refer to ethnically Japanese people born outside of Japan.  Kikumitsu is a Nisei because she is ethnically demonic but born outside of the demon world."
  },
